msgid "Bridge offload (bridge-mgr)"
msgstr "网桥卸载（bridge-mgr）"

msgid "ECM accelerated connections"
msgstr "ECM 加速连接"

msgid "ECM not loaded"
msgstr "ECM 未加载"

msgid "Each standalone switch port reaches the firmware as its own VLAN node on the GMAC above, and so does each bridge: the ports of a bridge share one node, listed under one of them. The offloaded share is part of the GMAC's figures above; the totals here are that port's own switch counters."
msgstr "每个独立交换机端口以单独的 VLAN 节点接入上述 GMAC。网桥成员端口共享一个节点，显示在其中一个端口下。卸载比例计入上方 GMAC 的统计；此处总数来自各端口自身的交换机计数器。"

msgid "Fast lane"
msgstr "优先通道"

msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

msgid "Firmware armed but heartbeat silent — check the system log; a reboot returns to the host stack"
msgstr "固件已启用但没有心跳，请检查系统日志；重启后会回到主机处理模式"

msgid "Firmware-attached ports"
msgstr "已接入固件的端口"

msgid "Heartbeat"
msgstr "心跳"

msgid "Host stack (NSS plane not armed)"
msgstr "主机处理（NSS 数据路径未启用）"

msgid "Link"
msgstr "链路"

msgid "NSS Offload"
msgstr "NSS 硬件加速"

msgid "NSS core load"
msgstr "NSS 核心占用"

msgid "NSS offload active (wifili)"
msgstr "NSS 无线加速已启用（wifili）"

msgid "NSS offload active (wifili, 802.11s mesh offloaded)"
msgstr "NSS 无线加速已启用（wifili，802.11s Mesh 已卸载）"

msgid "No ports attached — host stack"
msgstr "未接入端口，由主机处理"

msgid "Offload active"
msgstr "硬件加速运行中"

msgid "Offload"
msgstr "负载"

msgid "Offloaded packets are forwarded by the firmware and never reach the host. \"via host\" / \"to host\" is the host↔firmware exception path — what was not offloaded — so low numbers there mean offload is working. Broadcast and multicast discovery, connection setup, short-lived flows and traffic addressed to the router itself always take that path: a flow is only offloaded once it is established, so a quiet port that carries little else shows a low offloaded share. Port totals are on Status → Overview."
msgstr "已卸载的数据包由固件转发，不经过主机。“发送经主机”和“接收至主机”表示未卸载的主机与固件之间的异常处理路径，计数较低通常说明卸载正在工作。广播、组播发现、连接建立、短连接和发往路由器本机的流量会经过这条路径。连接建立后才能卸载，因此低流量端口的卸载比例可能较低。端口总量见“状态 → 概览”。"

